Cell["\<\
This document is a practical  introduction to designing macro-scale neural \
circuits built around the topological associative memory described at \
creatingintelligence.org. Circuits represent stateful machines that operate \
on hyperdimensional sparse distributed representations. \
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"87579e7b-f6a0-41f8-82c2-9eb95fc7b7df"],

Cell["\<\
A compact dataflow description language  fully specifies circuits composed of \
standardized building blocks:\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"ff9293d6-529a-4cc5-b93f-c817ac552344"],

