Cell["Difference update", "Subsubsection",ExpressionUUID->"6dd32089-4b55-49ba-a41f-65031426563d"],

Cell["\<\
Auto-associative memory using the \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]difference\
\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] update rule replaces the state with the symmetric \
difference between the query pattern and the recalled pattern.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"89a9c686-ca0f-4950-a716-99ea648f67f0"],

